		<dict>
			<key>NativeSourceComparison</key>
			<string>The 24 selected 1x frames match the official Apple 30-frame CursorAsset_base artwork within one premultiplied channel value, preserving its 0.5-second cycle. The 2x and 10x representations remain from the previously documented Sequoia VM export; their original generation path is not independently established.</string>
			<key>OriginalFrameCount</key>
			<integer>30</integer>
			<key>Processing</key>
			<string>Uniform nearest-frame sampling across the complete cycle; native bitmap rows copied without pixel conversion or rescaling and stored as lossless LZW TIFF; original cycle duration preserved.</string>
